  "gif-to-png": ["Drag a GIF onto the drop zone, or click to choose a .gif file.","Wait a moment while the GIF is decoded and each frame is converted to PNG in your browser.","Download a single PNG, click any frame to save it, or download all frames as a ZIP."],
